msgstr "Kí ni o fẹ́ ṣe maapu rẹ?"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:6
msgid ""
"Pick the option that fits your project. You can change your mind later by"
" starting over."
msgstr ""
"Yan aṣayan tó bá iṣẹ́ akanṣe rẹ mu. O lè yi ọkàn rẹ pada nigbamii nipa "
"bíbere lẹ́ẹ̀kansi."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:20
#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:32
msgid "Add tags to OSM buildings"
msgstr "Ṣafikun awọn afi si awọn ile OSM"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:23
msgid "Quickest way to start. Just draw your area on the map and you're done."
msgstr "Ọna tó yara jù láti bẹ̀rẹ̀. Kan fa agbegbe rẹ sori maapu, o ti pari."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:27
msgid "Use building outlines already in OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Lo awọn ilana ile tẹlẹ ni OpenStreetMap"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:28
msgid "Includes a ready-made survey to add OSM tags to existing buildings"
msgstr ""
"Pẹlu iwadi ti a ti ṣetan lati ṣafikun awọn afi OSM si awọn ile ti o wa "
"tẹlẹ"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:29
msgid "Fill in gaps for unmapped buildings during digitisation"
msgstr "Fọwọsi awọn ela fun awọn ile ti a ko ti ya aworan lakoko dijitization"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:38
#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:97
msgid "More details about this option"
msgstr "Awọn alaye diẹ sii nipa aṣayan yii"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:44
msgid "How this option is set up"
msgstr "Bawo ni a ṣe ṣeto aṣayan yii"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:46
msgid "Mapping happens in QField on Android."
msgstr "Iyaworan ṣẹlẹ ni QField lori Android."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:48
msgid ""
"The area is split into tasks of ~10 buildings each, using roads, rivers,\n"
"              railways and airstrips as boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Agbegbe ti pin si awọn iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ti ~10 ile kọọkan, lilo awọn ọna, awọn "
"odo,\n"
"              Reluwe ati airstrips bi aala."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:51
msgid "Photo upload is enabled but optional."
msgstr "Gbigbe fọto ṣiṣẹ ṣugbọn o jẹ iyan."

